- action(n1, "start screening staff process"): Hallucinates an initial step; the source explicitly states "the process begins by reviewing the support request."
- action(n4, "You have completed this procedure"): Hallucinates a concluding action; the source simply states that once communication is complete, "the process comes to an end," without defining a separate confirmation step.
- actor(a_default, "Default", [i1, n1, n2, n3, n4, e1]): Misassigns responsibility to a generic "Default" actor instead of the explicitly named "screening staff."